      "id": 5,
      "options": {
        "code": {
          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        },
        "content": "## Request path\n\nConsumer workload -> github-sts -> OIDC/JWKS -> JTI backend -> policy resolution -> GitHub App pool/token API\n\n## Background and telemetry paths\n\nOCI bundle registry -> signature verification -> policy evaluation\n\ngithub-sts -> Prometheus / Loki / Tempo\n\nSelect one environment above. Open Request Investigation for a concrete trace and logs.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.0.0",
      "title": "How the Stack Fits Together",
      "type": "text"
    },
